        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b) The RVA will be posted for six and one-half (6½) working days closing at 5:00 p.m. on the sixth day. The driver or attendant interested in placing a bid is responsible for delivery of that bid to the depot manager by the closing date. Buses should not be used to deliver bids.",
