            "block_content": "5. Drivers and attendants will be allowed only two (2) changes in regular morning/afternoon runs per school year; drivers and attendants may make these changes at any time during the school year without restriction. For the purpose of this subsection, “extra work,” (including midday runs, activity runs, and other like assignments) which is bid separately, will not be considered a “change.”",
